<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1BAT 53 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya kutanguna ya Paulo ku Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya kutanguna ya Paulo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">BUSANSULUSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata yakutanguna kuli Batesalonika yalalembwa ne mutumwa Paulo 1:1 Yela kuba kalata yakutanguna njalalemba Paulo iyo yalaba cibela ca Baibulo, kayi yalalembwa byaka 51 panyuma pakusemwa kwa Klistu. Paulo walikuba mu Kolinto mpwalikulemba kalata iyi njalalembela Batesalonika, mubungano ngwalabyala mubulwendo bwakendi bwatubili 17:1-10. Mulibuku lya Ncito mulambangeti mubungano uwu mwalikuba Bayuda, nsombi bangi balikuba Bagiliki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo liya kwikalisha cindi citali mu Tesalonika panyuma pakubyala mubungano uwu, neco kali lafumuko walatuma iyi kalata yakubayuminisha baklistu. Mukalata iyi muli nkani shingi ne malailile angi ambuli mobela kwikalila baklistu. Paulo walasha mano ku kubwela kwatubili kwa Klistu. Mpani baklistu ba ku Tesalonika emakani ngobalikuyandishisha kwishiba. Paulo walasebensensha kubwela kwatubili kwa Klistu kwambeti kubeti ceshikubanyakilisha kukuba ne bwikalo bwaina bwaciklistu bukute kukondwelesha Lesa. 5:6-8</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo latatikinga kalata iyi pakupa mitende mubungano kulumba Lesa cebo ca endibo</para>
  <para style="io1">Lino lambanga sha ncito shakendi, ne mulumbe ngwalaleta Timoti 2-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo, Paulo lapanga malailile angi ancobela kwikala kabali bamunikilwa nekubwela kwatubili kwa Yesu 4:1 mpaka 5:15</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lapwishinga nekupa mitende mubungano nekubasengeti uliyense mumubungano abelenge iyi kalata 5:16-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njafwe, Paulo ne Sailasi kayi ne Timoti. Tulamulembelenga ba Tesalonika momubungano mukasa a Lesa ne Mwami Yesu Klistu. Luse ne lumuno Lube nenjamwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Sha buyumi ne lushomo lwa ba Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tulalumbumga Lesa lyonse pacebo ca njamwe mwense kayi lyonse tulamushumbulunga mumipailo yetu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tukute kumwanuka pamenso a Lesa pabintu mbyomwalensa pacebo ca lushomo lwenu, kayi mbuli ncomwalasebensa cangofu lushomo, kayi ne lusuno lwalapesheti musebense mwangofu, kayi ne kupembelela kwenu Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu ncekwashimpa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mobanse tucinshi kwambeti Lesa umusuni kayi lamusala kuba bakendi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakwinga twalamuletela Mulumbe Waina, cakutasebensesha maswi onka, nsombi nengofu sha Mushimu Uswepa kayi cakutatonshanya sobwe. Mucinshi ncetwalikwikala nenjamwe, pakuyanda kumunyamfwilisha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwalakonkela bwikalo bwetu kayi ne bwa Mwami Yesu. Necikabeti mwalapita mumapensho anene, mwalatambula Mulumbe Waina mwakukondwa kwalakufuma ku Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco mwalaba citondesho kubantu bashoma muli Yesu mu Makedoniya ne ku Akaya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balanyumfwa Mulumbe Waina kufuma kulinjamwe kutambowa abo baku Akaya ne ku Makedoniya bonka, nsombi impuwo ya lushomo lwenu muli Lesa yalamwaika ku masena onse. Neco lino kuliya ncotwela kwambapo sobwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balambanga sha ncemwalatutambula cena pacindi mpotwalamufwakashila, kayi mbuli ncemwalatushiya tumbwanga, nekusandukila kuli Lesa muyumi kwambeti mumusebenselenga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi mulapembelelenga Mwanendi kufuma kwilu. Uyo ni Yesu, Lesa ngwalapundusha kubafu. Euyo latupulushunga ku bukalu bulesanga.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mulimo wa Paulo ku Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mobanse, amwe mobene mucinshi kwambeti kufwakasha kwetu kwalikuba kwaina. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mucinshi mbuli bantu baku Filipi ncobalatupensha nekutusebanya, katutana kwisa ku Tesalonika. Necikabeco Lesa walatuyumisha moyo mpaka twalacikosha kumukambaukila Mulumbe Waina weshikufuma kulyendiye nambi bangi balikutoteka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga mbyetwalikukambauka nkatwalasebensesha miyeyo yaipa nambi kuyanda kubepa bantu sobwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nsombi tukute kukambauka mbuli Lesa ncakute kuyandeti twinse, pakwinga Lesa walatusuminisha kwambeti twelela kupewa mulimo wakukambauka Mulumbe Waina. Nkatuleleshenga kukondwelesha bantu sobwe, nsombi kukondwelesha Lesa uyo ukute kwinshiba miyeyo yetu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mucinshi cena kwambeti nkatwalesa kulinjamwe ne maswi akuyanda kumukondwelesha nambi kwambeti tucaninepo pindu kulinjamwe, Lesa ekamboni wetu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkatwalayanda kulumbwa ne muntu uliyense nambi amwe, nambi bambi, <verse number="7" style="v"/>cakubinga mpotwalasenga lunyamfo netukaba batumwa ba Yesu Klistu twalalibombelesha pakumusenga bintu mbuli mushali mutukashi ncakute kulama cena banabendi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pacebo cakumusunishisha twalikuba twalibambila kumuyabila Mulumbe Waina weshi kufuma kuli Lesa kayi ne buyumi bwetu. Pakwinga mwalikuba mwasunika kulinjafwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mobanse mwengashila cena mbuli ncotwalasebensa cangofu pakati penu, twalasebensa munshi ne mashiku kwambeti tutamupensha mubintu mbyotwalikuyanda kusebensesha mpotwali kumukambaukila Mulumbe Waina wa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Njamwe bakamboni betu pamo ne Lesa, kwambeti bwikalo bwetu pakati penu amwe bashoma bwalikuba bwaswepa, bwalululama kayi bwabula kampenda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino mucinshi kwambeti twalikushako mano kuli uliyense pakati penu mbuli mushali mutuloba ncakute kulama banabendi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Twalamuyuminisha ne kumutontosha myoyo, kayi ne kumwambila cangofu kwambeti mwelela kuba ne bwikalo bwakukondwelesha Lesa, uyo lamukunga kwambeti mukengile mu Bwami bwabulemu bwakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba kuli cebo nacimbi cikute kupesheti tulumbaishe Lesa. Mpotwalamuletela Mulumbe Waina mwalaukutika nekusumina. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mobanse, bintu bimobimo byalamwinshikila byalenshikila kumibungano ya Lesa ili muli Yesu Klistu yaku Yudeya. Nomba bantu bakucomwenu balamupensha mbuli Bayuda ncebalapensha baklistu baku Yudeya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Abo balashina Mwami Yesu ne bashinshimi balikubako kaindi, kayi ebalatupensha. Aba nkabakute kukondwelesha Lesa sobwe, kayi ebapelana ne bantu bonse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Balelesha kutukanisha kukambuka Mulumbe Waina kubantu ba kunsa kwambeti batambule lupulusho. Neco balalibunjikila bwipishi bwabo bonse cakwambeti bukalu bwa Lesa bulabashikili.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo layandanga kufwakashila ku Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mobanse necikabeti twalapansana nenjamwe kwa kacindi cing'ana kumubili nsombi mumiyeyo tuli pamo, twalikuyandishisha kwambeti tukabonane menso ne menso. Nambi twalamushiya myoyo yetu yalikubowa nenjamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi twalikuyandishisha kubwelela kwisa kumubona, ame ndalelekesha kwisa kayi nteko kankanda kamowa nsombi tubili, nomba Satana walatabankana panshila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anu kupembelela kwetu nicani? Inga kukondwa kwetu nicani? Kayi ne cilambo cetu nicani ncetwelela kutwangila Mwami wetu akesa? Sena ntamwe?. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Cakubinga bulemu bwetu nekukondwa kwetu njamwe.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pakupwililisha, pacebo cakwambeti twalaliwa kuliyuminisha, neco twalayeya kwambeti twikale kwatwenka ku Atene. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco twalatuma Timoti mukwetu uyo ukute kusebensela Lesa pamo nenjafwe mukukambauka Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu. Twalamutuma kwambeti ese ayuminishe lushomo lwenu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwambeti kakutaba naba umo pakati penu wela kubwelela kunyuma pacebo ca mapensho ayo alamushikili. Nomba mucinshi kwambeti mapensho amushoboyu elela kumushikila kwelana ne kuyanda kwa Lesa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga pacindi mpotwalikuba pamo nenjamwe, twalamwambilila limo kwambeti nitukapenshewe kayi nenjamwe mucinsheti calenshika. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Weco mpotwalilwa kuliyuminisha, twalatuma Timoti kwambeti ese enshibe lushomo lwenu ncolubele. Pakwinga ndalikutina kwambeti mpani Satana lamusunku kendi, kwambeti ncito shetu kuli njamwe shilaba shabulyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino Timoti labwele kufuma kulinjamwe kayi latuletele mulumbe wa sha lushomo lwenu ne lusuno. Latwambilyeti mukute kutuyeya mwakukondwa, kayeti mukute kuyandishisha kutubona mbuli nenjafwe ncotukute kuyandishisha kumubona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacebo ici mobanse, lushomo lwenu muli Yesu lulalengeshe kwambeti tuyume moyo mumapensho ne miyeyo yetu yonse. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga lino tukute buyumi bwancine ncine na mulayumu mukwikatana ne Mwami Yesu Klistu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco pacebo canjamwe ngatumulumba Lesa. Tulamulumbunga nekusangalala cebo cakukondwa nkotukute pamenso akendi cebo canjamwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Munshi ne mashiku tukute kumusenga ne myoyo yetu yonse kwambeti atusuminishe kwisa akumubona kayi. Tulayandanga kumuyabila ibyo mbyomutana muba nabyo mulushomo lwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tulasengenga kwambeti Lesa Bata ne Mwami wetu Yesu, batubambile bulwendo bwetu bwa kwisa kwenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco Mwami Yesu akonempeshe lusuno lwenu ne kuyanda bantu bonse kwambeti mube ne lusuno mbuli ndotukute. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lesa ayuminishe myoyo yenu kwambeti mubule kampenda kalikonse, kayi kwambeti mube baswepa pamenso akendi kushikila Mwami Yesu akese pamo nebaswepa bakendi bonse.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pakupwililisha mobanse, mwalaiya kupitila mubwikalo bwetu mbuli ncomwela kwikala kwambeti mukondweleshe Lesa. Nomba ubu ebwikalo mbomwayandikanga kuba nabo, neco tulamusengenga muli lya Mwami Yesu kwambeti mweleshe kwinsa cangofu kupita ncemwalikwinsa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga mwaishi cena malailile ngotwalamupa kupitila mungofu sha Mwami Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lesa layandangeti mube baswepa, ne kutensa bufule. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Uliyense pakati penu enshibe kulela cena mubili wakendi, pakulemeka nekubamba cena, ne kutausafwanya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamutakomkelanga lunkumbwa lwasesemya mbuli ncebakute kwinsa bantu bakunsa batamwinshi Lesa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco, mumakani awa, kapataba muntu shikwinshila munendi caipa, nambi kumulyela masuku pamutwi. Twalamwambilisha kendi kwambeti Lesa nakabape cisubulo bantu bonse beshikwinsa bintu byamushoboyu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa nkalatukuwa kwambeti twinsenga bintu byaipa byabupombo, nsombi kuba baswepa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco na muntu lakana ciyisho ici, ekwambeti nkalakananga muntu sobwe, nsombi lakana Lesa uyo ukute kumupa Mushimu Uswepa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino nkandelela kumulembela sha lusuno pakati penu, pakwinga Lesa walamwiyisha kendi mbuli ncomwelela kuyandana umo ne umo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi mukute kuyanda banenu bonse bamu cishi ca Makedoniya. Nsombi tulamusengenga mobanse, kwambeti mwinse copeleco kupita kaindi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kamweleshani kwikala mubuyumi bwa lumuno, uliyense ashe mano ku ncito yakendi, kayi nekulicanina bintu bilayandikingga mubuyumi. Kamwinsani mbuli ncetwalamwambila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Munshila ilico, bantu batamwinshi Lesa nibakamupe bulemu, kayi nteti mukacunke manungo pali muntu uliyense mu bintu mbyemwabulilwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mobanse, tulayandanga kwambeti mwinshibe cancinencine sha makani abantu abo balafwa, kwambeti kulila kwenu kakutabeti bantu babula ncebalapembelelenga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakwinga afwe twashoma kwambeti Yesu walafwa kayi walapunduka. Neco twashoma kwambeti bantu bonse abo balafwa kabali bashoma Yesu, Lesa nakabapundushe pamo ne Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino tulamwiyishinga ciyisho ca Mwami mwine. Kwambeti afwe otucili bayumi kushikila Yesu akese, nteti tukabatangunine balafwa sobwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pakwinga nipakabe kompolola kwangofu, liswi lya mungelo mukulene ne liswi lya tolompita ya Lesa. Popelapo Mwami nakaseluke kufuma kwilu. Abo balafwila muli Yesu eshibakatangune kupunduka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino nenjafwe eshitukabenga bayumi pacindico, etitukashalepo, nitukamantwe pamo nendibo, ne kuya kukumana ne Mwami mwilu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neco kamuyumishanani umo ne umo sha maswi awa.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino mobanse nkacayandika kwambeti tumulembele shacindi nambi bushiku mposhi bikenshike ibi bintu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga amwe mobene mucinshi kendi kwambeti bushiku bwakwisa kwa Mwami Yesu nibukese eti kabwalala ncakute kwisa mashiku. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bantu bonse bakatatika kwambeti, “Palaba lumuno bintu byonse bilaba cena,” Popelapo mwakutayeyela ceshikubashina nicikashike mwakutilimusha, mbuli kubaba kwa mapensho akute kushikila mutukashi ulipepi kupulukamo. Cakubinga kuliyawa naba umo eshakafwambe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mobanse, nkamulipo mumushinshe, kwambeti ubo busuba bukamutilimushe mwakutayeyela mbuli kabwalala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakwinga mwense muli mumumuni, kayi ne munshi uli nenjamwe. Nkatulipo mumashiku nambi mumushinshe sobwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco katutona tulo mbuli bantu nabambi ncebabele, nsombi twelela kuba babangamana, katutaba bakolewa sobwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga bantu bakute kona mashiku, kayi bakute kukolewa cindi camashiku. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba afwe njafwe bantu beshikwinsa bintu bya mumuni, neco katutakolewanga. Twelela kufwala lushomo ne lusuno kubeti cakufwala ca nshimbi ceshikucinjilisha ntiti, kayi kupembelela kwetu kubeti cishoti ceshikunjilisha ku mutwi cakwambeti nitukapuluke. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa nkatukwila kwisa kupenshewa cebo ca bukalu bwakendi, nsombi kwambeti tutambule lupulusho kupitila muli Yesu Klistu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Uyo walatufwila kwambeti kwikale nebuyumi pamo nendiye, twacibanga bayumi nambi tufwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neco mulayandikinga kuyuminishanya kayi ne kunyamfwilishana mbuli ncomulenshinga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tulamusengenga mobanse, kwambeti mubapenga bulemu abo balamutangunininga nekumulesha ncomwela kwinsa pakati penu mubuyumi bwacklistulistu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mubape bulemu ne lusuno lwenu pacebo ca ncito njobalenshinga. Kayi mwikalenga mulumuno pakati penu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tulamusengenga kayi mobanse kwambeti mubacenjeshe batolo. Bayuminisheni bayowa ne balefuka kayi ne bantu bonse mwakwikalika moyo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kamutasumisha muntu kubweshela caipa pa caipa, nsombi cindi conse bayandishishenga kwinshilana bintu byaina palwenu kayi neku bantu bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kondwani masuba onse, <verse number="17" style="v"/>kamupailani kuli Lesa cindi conse, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Cindi conse kamulumbanga Lesa, pakwinga encakute kuyanda kwambeti mwinse cebo cakwambeti mwekatana ne Yesu Klistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kamutaukanishanga Mushimu uswepa, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kamutesebanya mulimo wa bushi shinshimi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino byelekesheni bintu byonse, kwambeti mubishibe na nibyancinencine. Amwe mumantepo byaina, <verse number="22" style="v"/>nekukana bwipishi buli bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino Lesa uyo latwikalikinga mulumuno, amuswepeshe munshila iliyonse. Amubambe cena mu mano asulila, mumoyo ne mumubili, kwambeti mukacanike babula bulema akesanga Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Uyo walamukuwa washomeka, kayi nakamwinshile bintu ibi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mobanse kamutupaililangonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mubape mitende banse bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lino ndamwabilinga kupitila mungofu sha Mwami kwambeti mubelenge kalata iyi kuli banenu bonse bashoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Luse lwa Mwami Yesu Klistu lube nenjamwe.</para>
</usx>
